@startuml file-watcher-state
title File Watcher — per-tab external-change lifecycle

[*] --> Clean : tab opened

Clean --> Clean : FileModified, !is_dirty()\n(silent reload)
Clean --> Modified : FileModified, is_dirty()
Clean --> Deleted : FileRemoved (any dirty state)

Modified --> Clean : Reload\n(reload_active_from_disk)
Modified --> Clean : Keep Mine\n(dismiss_external_change)
Modified --> Deleted : FileRemoved before a decision is made

Deleted --> Clean : dismiss_external_change

Clean --> [*] : tab closed
Modified --> [*] : tab closed
Deleted --> [*] : tab closed

@enduml
